        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Mutation applied to one declared agent variable in a batched UpdateAgentVariablesRequest. Mirrors Tryll::VariableOp (wire enum) — ordinal values must stay in sync.</para>
<para>Assign: overwrite; value must match the variable&apos;s declared type. AddToSet/RemoveFromSet: target must be StringSet; value carried in StringValue (idempotent — a no-op success if already present/absent). Reset: restore the CreateAgent-time initial value; no value fields are read. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
